<ontology/use_metallurgy_tinplate/use_metallurgy_tinplate__1050__q1/#resource> dcterms:bibliographicCitation "Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. IRON" ;
    dcterms:source <https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/44562> ;
    a <ontology/EvidenceQuote/#resource> ;
    rdfs:label "Evidence for Coke used in Metallurgy, Smelting, Brass & Tinplate: Andrew Ure, A Dictionary of Arts, Manufactures, and Mines (2nd ed., 1840; Project Gutenberg #44562), s.v. IRON"@en ;
    <ontology/quoteText/#resource> "In fact, no cold-blast furnace will carry so great a burden in summer as in winter, that is, afford so great a product of metal, or bear so great a charge of ore with the same quantity of coke."@en ;
    <ontology/retrievalMode/#resource> "direct_sentence" .
